                        , (S, Msb, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاعَمَهُ</span></b> , (S, K,)
<i>He</i> (God, S, Msb,) <i>made him to enjoy,</i> or <i>lead, a
plentiful, and a pleasant</i> or <i>an easy, and a soft,</i>
or <i>delicate, state,</i> or <i>life; a state,</i> or <i>life, of
